            Infection
  JOURNAL   J Virol 91 (13), e00432-17 (2017)
   PUBMED   28404855
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Among the genes enriched in this screening, the authors
            found that TM9SF2 is critical for N-sulfation of heparan sulfate
            and therefore for chikungunya virus infection because it is
            involved in the proper localization and stability of NDST1.
