            Chain and Divalent Cations
  JOURNAL   J Biol Chem 291 (9), 4658-4670 (2016)
   PUBMED   26728454
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Data suggest that Mg2+ or Mn2+ (but not Ca2+) induce a
            conformational change in inter-alpha-inhibitor (ITIH1 and ITIH2)
            and a bikunin/chondroitin sulfate-dependent increase in
            thermodynamic stability; bikunin binds adjacent to the two heavy
            chains.
